      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are identity matrices?\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nSelect all that apply.",
